# Every docked screen at Lave, from the start of a game: the status screen it opens on, then F2 to F10
# and Esc. Both charts move their cursor; the equipment screen buys a missile.
wait 3
key space; wait 4                  # any key: the credits, then the status screen
digest status 792adf1cdbd7874f6ad97b723312a5fbf12086b5637952458669794127a42548
key F2; wait 1
digest sell-cargo c3ed0ec986efab0444712b1473e608efef944116f8e6b414c5076757e88904f8
key F3; wait 1
digest buy-cargo 50a77972be460404a6af88edaad1db673472fe9a59ea4612f84d954b248c4bf6
key F4; wait 1
key Down; wait 0.5                 # from fuel to the missile
key b; wait 1                      # buy one
