down Right; wait 0.3; up Right; wait 0.5
digest galactic-chart 9e400291ff9af6e28e625bae02bbe1dc34714570dc6abf3023ed45c786d71f62
key F6; wait 1
down Left; wait 0.55; up Left; wait 0.05 # six frames of the short-range chart (D18): the cursor to Riedquat
